Third-party notice

1) The segment address map (digit/decimal-point RAM addresses) and the bit layout
   of the 16-segment patterns used in src/Unit_10d_16seg_LCD.cpp are based on
   https://github.com/road-t/DM8BA10, which is distributed under the MIT License.
   The patterns for '!', '^', '_', '`' and DEL in the font table are also taken from it:

  The MIT License (MIT)
  Copyright 2022 Ilya 'road-t' Annikov
  https://github.com/road-t/DM8BA10

2) The glyph shapes of the font table are the author's own adjusted design, whose starting point (75 of the 96 entries are still identical) was derived from
   the font "Calculate 16" (Calculate16-Grid.otf) by Benjamin Blåholtz (2019),
   https://www.dafont.com/calculate-16.font, listed on dafont.com as "100% Free".
   Only the on/off state of each of the 16 segments was taken from the font; the
   font file itself is not included. The download does not contain a license
   text, so check the terms with the author before redistributing.
